SHOUR HAI YAHI BARPA QATL HOGAYE MOULA<br>
<br>
1. Shour Hai Yahi Barpa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
 Roorahaa Hai Sab Koofa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
2. Betiyaan Ye Kahti Hai Yunn Na Jaayiey Baba.<br>
 Karrahe Hain Sab Giriyaa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
3. Saare Shayhere Koofa May Gham Ki Hai Fiza Chaayie.<br>
 Har Taraf Hai Yeh Charcha Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
4. Kya Sitam Kiya Moula Tumpe Ibne Mulijim Ne.<br>
 Kaanpi Masjid E Koofa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
5. Koun Ab Qabar Lega Bekason Ki Aye Baba.<br>
 Zulm Ye Huwa Kaisa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
6. Ab Janaza Uthta Hai Ghar Se Mere Moula Ka.<br>
 Hashr Sa Hai Ek Barpa Qatl Hoagye Moula.<br>
<br>
7. Baanttha Tha Raaton Ko Rizq Jo Ghareebon May.<br>
 Koun Hai Ab Unn Sab Ka Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
8. Haaye Shayhere Koofa May Chhagayi Fiza Gham Ki.<br>
 Chaar Sou Hai Sannata Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
9. Zindagi May Ahmed Ko Murtuza Se Dhhaaras Thi.<br>
 Do Nabi Ko Sab Pursa Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
10.Tegh Ibne Muljim Ne Sar Pejab Lagayii Hai.<br>
 Tha Lahoo May Sab Chehra Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
<br>
<br>
11.Haaye Ahle Koofa May Tha Sohail Ek Mehshar.<br>
 Lab Pe Sab Ke Tha Nouha Qatl Hogaye Moula.<br>
